Date: Fri, 31 Oct 2025 09:26:35 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 02/15] feat(keyring): Implement KeyringHandler class using
 keyctl util

This is using keyctl from the kernel keyutils package. The
python-keyring package is pulling too many dependencies. Like support
for secret storage which then includes dbus etc.

Co-Authored-by: Claude <noreply@antrophic.com>
